  "label": "Support External API",
  "purpose": "Extend VexLife-Prod's existing selectable-model, direct-Companion and capability architecture so one Vex Home can intentionally select either a local model or an external Partner provider/model while VexLife remains the owner of Conversation, Memory, contextual ground, capability admission, lifecycle and durable evidence; add truthful provider-connection, credential, availability, failure and privacy semantics; preserve explicit no-automatic-fallback behavior; prove provider adapters and failure handling deterministically without paid API access; and leave real external-provider qualification as an explicit later gate rather than treating synthetic proof as live completion.",
